# Build tools for M14. Never shipped, but they write what is shipped, so they get a hashed lock (research 8.2).
# Every distribution the lock resolves must be in APPROVED_DISTS, APPROVED_DEV_DISTS or APPROVED_BUILD_DISTS in
# tools/offline_rules.py. Installed beside requirements-dev.lock, so its shared pins are held at the same versions.
-c requirements-dev.lock
pyinstaller
# Windows-only dependencies of PyInstaller, named without markers on purpose: a Linux compile drops Windows-only markers.
pefile
pywin32-ctypes
